## Practical 3 – Manual Test Case Design and Execution

**Steps:**

1. Open browser → navigate to `https://practicetestautomation.com/practice-test-login/`
2. Study the page: Username field, Password field, Submit button, Error message, Success page.
3. Open Microsoft Excel / Google Sheets → create workbook.
4. **Sheet 1: Test Plan** — create table:

   | Test Plan Item | Description |
   |---|---|
   | Project Name | Login Page Testing |
   | Application | Practice Test Automation |
   | Module | Login |
   | Objective | Verify Login Functionality |
   | Scope | Username, Password and Login Button |
   | Testing Type | Manual Functional Testing |
