## Practical 5 – WebElement Interaction Using Selenium WebDriver

**Steps:**

1. Sign in to GitHub → open repository: `https://github.com/Conceicaodsouza/STQA-WebElement-Practical`
2. Click **Code** → **Codespaces** → **Create codespace on main** → wait for load.
3. Verify project structure: `pom.xml`, `src/test/java/practical/BrowserTest.java`, `src/test/resources/web-elements.html`.
4. Open `BrowserTest.java` and review its logic (open HTML page, locate text box, enter/verify text, locate dropdown, select/verify option, close browser).
5. Open **Terminal** → run:
   ```
   sudo apt-get update
   sudo apt-get install -y maven chromium chromium-driver
   ```
6. Verify installations:
   ```
   mvn -version
   chromium --version
   chromedriver --version
   ```
7. Run the test:
   ```
   mvn test
   ```
8. Verify output: `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0` and `BUILD SUCCESS`.

**Java Code (full, paste into BrowserTest.java):**

```java
package practical;

import org.junit.Test;
import static org.junit.Assert.*;
import org.openqa.selenium.By;
import org.openqa.selenium.WebDriver;
import org.openqa.selenium.WebElement;
import org.openqa.selenium.chrome.ChromeDriver;
import org.openqa.selenium.chrome.ChromeOptions;
import org.openqa.selenium.support.ui.Select;

public class BrowserTest {

    @Test
    public void browserTest() {
        WebDriver driver = null;
        try {
            ChromeOptions options = new ChromeOptions();
            options.addArguments("--headless=new");
            options.addArguments("--no-sandbox");
            options.addArguments("--disable-dev-shm-usage");
            options.addArguments("--disable-gpu");
            options.addArguments("--window-size=1920,1080");
            options.setBinary("/usr/bin/chromium");

            driver = new ChromeDriver(options);

            String filePath = System.getProperty("user.dir") + "/src/test/resources/web-elements.html";
            driver.get("file://" + filePath);

            assertEquals("Web Element Interaction Practical", driver.getTitle());

            WebElement nameInput = driver.findElement(By.id("name"));
            nameInput.sendKeys("Conceicao");
            assertEquals("Conceicao", nameInput.getAttribute("value"));

            WebElement countryDropdown = driver.findElement(By.id("country"));
            Select countrySelect = new Select(countryDropdown);
            countrySelect.selectByVisibleText("India");
            assertEquals("India", countrySelect.getFirstSelectedOption().getText());

        } finally {
            if (driver != null) {
                driver.quit();
            }
        }
    }
}
```

